    "tree_id": "54869328ae1583c922fb25e733bb663c8313046f",
    "message": "[ipa-delivery:721] build(delivery): request the private common IPA 721 again (first attempt failed on a load-dependent floor of a MeloNX journal test; fixed and refrozen)\n\nRefrozen manifest build-utils/delivery/721.json on the delivered 720 (freeze\ncommit of the draft after 653bb484, effective digest e66096fe, 7484 product\nfiles, three reviewed commits: the PR 168 merge, the Core 919 source and the\njournal test fix; legal check passed). Same components as the first request:\nRPCS3 Core 919 pin 44527c61, MeloNX Core 719 and MeloNXMoltenVKStandalone\nretained. First request (run 42819476474): preflight, republish and flutter\ngreen, the application compiled; native failed in\ntest/melonx_perf_journal_test.py on a 10 % floor of a 0.25 s CPU sample (7 % on\nthe shared runner). The fix changes the effective tree, so both groups run\nfresh again. Delivery contract 61 tests OK (4 skipped), contract 721 exit 0,\ntrigger paths accepted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-10T13:14:01Z",
